.TH POPEINPUT-SETTINGS 1 "September 2026" "popeinput 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
popeinput-settings \- settings window for popeinput
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B popeinput-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a COSMIC-style window to choose the input engine (libcangjie or RIME),
the RIME schema, Cangjie version and mode, character sets, candidates per page,
full-width characters, how Chinese input is toggled, and the popup font size.
Changes are written to cosmic-config and picked up by
.BR popeinput (1)
immediately.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR popeinput (1)
